[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "到着！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ってことで、ここがアルビちゃん\nオススメのお店で～す！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And this is Alvie's recommended shop!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ……すごい！\n干物とか乾物がいっぱい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... amazing! So many dried fish and preserved foods!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "他にも塩漬け肉なんかもあるけど、\nここのが比較的安定して美味しい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They also have salt-cured meats, but this place consistently makes the tastiest ones!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "漬ける時の塩の比率を\n独自に研究してるんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They've developed their own special salt ratio for curing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇー……って、わわ……！\n分かってたけど、なかなかいいお値段だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... whoa! I mean, I expected it, but these prices are pretty steep."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、こういうのは手が込んでますからのぉ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you're paying for the craftsmanship, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これをそれなりの量を発注するとなると……\n結構な出費になりそうかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we order a decent amount of this, it's going to cost quite a bit..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、だからって錬金術だけで用意するのも\nそれはそれで面白味はないし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though just making everything with alchemy wouldn't be very interesting either..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、レスナ？\n発注する食料のメモとかある？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Resna? Do you have a list of the food you need to order?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あるけど……それがどうしたのアルビーナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I do, but... what are you planning, Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それ、貸して！\u3000ここはアタシが\nなんとかしてみるから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me see it! Leave this to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "というわけで、\n３割引きでいいってさ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, they're giving us a 30% discount!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！？\u3000さ、３割引き！？\u3000仰天驚愕！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! A 30% discount?! That's incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう！\u3000数を発注してくれるなら\nそれくらいは問題ないって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! They said it's no problem if we're placing a large order."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それと、また発注してくれるなら、\n次は４割引きにしてくれるみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And if we order from them again, they'll give us 40% off next time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さ、さすがにそれは\n小粋な冗談、なんじゃ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-surely that's just a little joke..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "冗談とは言わせないって！\n言質はしっかりと取ってるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's no joke! I got their word on it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "割引じゃなくても、\n他のサービスを手厚くしてもらったり――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And even without the discount, they could provide other special services—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……って、あれ？\u3000どうかした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Huh? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが、評判の案内人さん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As expected of the famous guide!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが、評判の案内人さん！\nすごすぎるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As expected of the famous guide! You're amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやぁ～、それほどでも～……\nえへへへへ♪",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, it's nothing special... Ehehehehe♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "案内だけじゃなくて、交渉もお手のもの\nなんて！\u3000ちょっと尊敬しちゃうかも！\n私じゃ無理だったなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not just guiding, but negotiating too! I'm actually a bit in awe! I could never have done that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、尊敬！？\nや、やめてくださいよ、レスナせんぱーい♪",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-awe?! P-please stop, Miss Resna♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ以上ほめてもなんにも出ないって～♪\nまったく、も～♪",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "More compliments won't get you anything else~♪ Honestly, geez~♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しっかりしてるなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're really reliable"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しっかりしてるなあ。\n私じゃ、こうはいかなかったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're really reliable. I couldn't have managed that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、アタシもいい大人ですから。\nこれくらいはお手のものっすよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I am a responsible adult. This kind of thing is second nature to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まあ、こんな風に交渉できるように\nなるまで、何度も失敗を繰り返して\nきたわけだけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Though I had to fail many times before I got good at negotiating like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やけにすんなり値引きしてくれると思ったら\n今イチな品だったり、\n在庫処理ついでだったりしてさ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sometimes I'd get a suspiciously easy discount, only to discover the goods were low quality or they were just clearing inventory..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんとか値下げしてもらったと思ったら、\nその値段より他のお店の定価のほうが\n安かったり……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Or I'd think I negotiated a great deal, only to find out another shop's regular price was cheaper..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一流になるのも楽じゃないんだよね～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Becoming first-rate isn't easy~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなりの苦労があったんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you've had your share of struggles too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まるで有力な商人みたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just like a skilled merchant"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かなり慣れてるね。\nまるで有力な商人みたいだったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're really experienced. You reminded me of a skilled merchant!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、そんなにほめられるとは\n思ってもみませんでしたね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, I never expected so many compliments..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、お客さんを案内した時に\n何度も交渉役をやってるからねー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I've negotiated plenty of times while guiding tourists."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このくらいはなんてことないっす",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is nothing special."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いつかクラウディアさんにも\n\u3000会わせてみたいなあ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I should introduce her to Klaudia sometime.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――あっ。\nただ、このお店にはないものもあるみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Oh! They don't have everything on your list, though."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、そうなんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だけど、ご安心を！\nまだまだいいお店に心当たりあるから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But don't worry! I know plenty of other good shops!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでも知ってるんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You really know everything"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当になんでも知ってるんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You really do know everything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然！\nこの島のことならなんでもござれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! I'm your go-to girl for anything on this island!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "超巨大ぷにの寝床から、\n財宝が眠ると言われている\n入り組んだ地下遺跡の案内までできます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From the nesting grounds of giant punis to the winding underground ruins rumored to hide treasure—I can guide you to them all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、そういうのは立ち入り禁止\nなんだけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though those places are off-limits, technically."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさかそのお店でも値切りを！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Will you haggle at that shop too?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさかそのお店でも値切りを！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Will you haggle at that shop too?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっふっふ。お望みとあらば\nやっちゃいますよ、もう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh heh heh. If that's what you want, I'll make it happen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特にそこの店主のおじいちゃんは、\n子どもの頃から\nアタシをかわいがってくれてて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Especially since the old man who runs that shop has known me since I was a child."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いわゆる、孫割り？\nみたいなのが利くんだよね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I get what you might call the 'grandchild discount'!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう、それを聞くとちょっと\n気が引けるかも……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, now I feel a bit guilty...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お礼、島外での冒険の話だけでいいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is adventure stories really enough payment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に至れり尽くせりだけど……\nお礼、島外での冒険の話だけでいいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're doing so much for us... Are adventure stories really enough payment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり、プロにお願いしてるし\nその辺りはキッチリしておいたほうが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since you're a professional, I feel like we should properly compensate you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "充分だって。\n最初に言った通り、アタシが案内したくて\n案内してるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's more than enough. Like I said at the beginning, I wanted to guide you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにアタシにとっての冒険話は、\nそれだけの価値があるもの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And for me, adventure stories are worth their weight in gold!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うに袋にうにが必要なように、\n今のアタシの人生には\n冒険話が必要なの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just like a sea urchin needs its shell, my life right now needs adventure stories!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなんだ。\nうん、分かったよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Alright, I understand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく、ありがとう！\n色々してもらっちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, thank you! You're doing so much for us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういたしまして！\nさあ、それじゃあ\n次のお店に行きましょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're welcome! Now then, shall we head to the next shop?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて、残りのものは\nここで全部揃うと思うんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think we can get everything else we need at this place..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "またちょっとだけ待ってて\nもらってもいい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you mind waiting just a bit longer?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここもアタシの巧みな交渉術で\nいくらかまけてもらえないか\n頼んでみるから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll see if my negotiation skills can get us another discount!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それは、ありがたいよ。\n\u3000確かにありがたいんだけど……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's helpful, it really is, but...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ここまでずっと\n\u3000アルビーナに頼りっきりだし……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I've been relying on Alvina this whole time...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次のお店は私が頑張ってみようかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I should try negotiating at the next shop?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "削除",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次のお店は私が頑張ってみようかな？\n何かコツとかあったりする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I should try negotiating at the next shop? Any tips you could share?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コツっすか？\nやっぱりまずは目を見ること、っすわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tips? Well, the first thing is to maintain eye contact."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとは一度大きく値切ってみて、\n徐々に値切り後の値段を上げてみるとか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then start by asking for a big discount, and gradually increase your offer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでもあんまり値切ってくれない時は、\n他のお店に行く素振りを見せるといいっすね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If they still won't budge much, act like you're about to leave for another shop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうすると\n客を逃がしたくないって心理が働くのか、\n交渉に応じてくれる可能性が高まるんすよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That often works because they don't want to lose a customer, so they're more likely to agree to your terms."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も交渉してみたいけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd like to try negotiating, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も交渉してみたいけど、\n実践するのは難しそう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd like to try negotiating, but it seems difficult to put into practice..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど？\nこういうのは慣れですよ、慣れ！\n挑戦あるのみ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all about practice! The only way to learn is to try!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、未知への挑戦もある意味で冒険！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, taking on new challenges is an adventure in its own way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かに、一理あるかも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's actually a good point."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でしょ！？\nとは言え、いきなりってのも\n酷な話だし――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right?! Though it might be a bit much to throw you in the deep end—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずはアルビちゃん大先生の背中を見て\n色々と学ぶのもひとつの手っすよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, you can learn by watching the great Professor Alvie in action!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "予算も余裕あるし値切らなくても……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have plenty of budget, so maybe we don't need to haggle..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "予算も余裕あるし……\nここは無理に値切ったりしなくてもいいよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have plenty of budget... so maybe we don't need to haggle?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、節約できるなら節約したほうが\nいいって！\nお財布は厚ければ厚いほどいいんすから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way! If you can save money, you should! The fatter your wallet, the better!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、それはそうなんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, that's true, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "世の中いつ貧乏になるかわからないよ？\nその時のために、いつでもどこでも\nがめつく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You never know when you might become poor! That's why you should pinch pennies wherever you can!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それがいつも貧乏な\nアルビちゃん流世渡り術！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the Alvie Method of Survival for the Perpetually Broke!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（う……切実だ！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ouch... she's serious about this!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ささ、行きましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, let's go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（現地の情報に詳しくて\n\u3000上手いこと引率とかしてくれるし……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She knows all the local information and guides us so well...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（現地の人との仲介役にもなってくれるし、\n\u3000だれと話す時も明るく笑顔……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She mediates with the locals and always keeps a bright smile on her face...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（これ以上ないくらい完璧な案内人だよね。\n\u3000天職だと思うけどなあ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's pretty much the perfect guide. This really seems like her calling.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも、これだけできる子だと、\n\u3000私、先輩として教えられることが\n\u3000何もないかも……！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But if she's this capable, I'm not sure what I can teach her as a senior alchemist...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]